      "align": null,
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "We want blogging to feel less like posting to the void, and more like sharing with a community. From pckt notes to better discovery, everything we've built over the last few weeks is designed to help bloggers connect.",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Hey Bloggers! ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Since our last post, we've shipped a ton of new features and bug fixes. We've been so busy working on making ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "pckt",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " better that we almost forgot to tell you about everything that's new. ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Let's start with the biggest new feature—",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "pckt notes",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": ". ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "socialPost",
      "post": {
