    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Sometimes there's something you want to say that doesn't need a full blog post. ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "pckt notes",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " are a brand new way to share bite-sized information. Think quick thoughts, or live blogging, or small updates throughout your day. Notes can be shared, quoted, or re-blogged, and they can either stand on their own or become part of the conversation around a longer blog post. ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "socialPost",
      "post": {
        "platform": "bluesky",
        "uri": "at://did:plc:revjuqmkvrw6fnkxppqtszpv/app.bsky.feed.post/3mqpzujjs4s2q",
        "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:revjuqmkvrw6fnkxppqtszpv/post/3mqpzujjs4s2q",
        "author": {
          "did": "did:plc:revjuqmkvrw6fnkxppqtszpv",
          "handle": "pckt.blog",
          "name": "pckt.blog",
          "avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:revjuqmkvrw6fnkxppqtszpv/bafkreic22tl2yrbl5ts3uar3j6zsvfbjpodlf27kybyzdo2js5zqzynz7m@jpeg",
          "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:revjuqmkvrw6fnkxppqtszpv"
        },
        "siteUrl": null,
        "text": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "notes enables a lot of things.\n\na pckt note can:\n\n-be a short thought\n-be a comment on a blog\n-reblog an article\n-quote post an article\n-reblog or quote another note\n-be posted as you or your blog\n\nthe idea is to have a social layer to help distribute blog posts and open up discussion on pckt :)",
            "marks": {},
            "link": null
          }
        ],
        "createdAt": "2026-07-16T00:59:49.415Z",
        "images": [],
        "external": null,
        "video": null,
        "quote": null,
        "mediaHidden": false
      }
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "You can publish notes as either yourself, or as one of your blogs. ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "socialPost",
      "post": {
        "platform": "pckt",
