            "url": "https://kandyelmo.pckt.blog/being-online-is-worth-it-sometimes-hs9jt4e",
            "title": "Being Online is Worth It Sometimes",
            "description": "A couples of months, I got some stickers from this platform thanks to . As of now, they're both plastered on my laptop and water bottle. This isn't the first that I got sent something from anyone online, but this definitely got me thinking about my presence all over the place, digitally. A good chunk of my time online has just been me expanding that digital footprint by feeding it the growth I had throughout my upbringing. All the lessons learned, all the changes in different parts of my identit...",
